# Development

## Prerequisites

- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) 20+
- [pnpm](https://pnpm.io/)
- [just](https://just.systems/)
- [Docker](https://www.docker.com/) (for dependencies)

## Setup

```sh
# Install dependencies
pnpm install

# Copy environment file
cp .env.example .env
```
{% if include_database and database_type == "postgres" %}
## Database

```sh
# Start Postgres
docker compose up -d

# Run migrations
pnpm exec prisma migrate deploy

# Generate Prisma client
pnpm exec prisma generate
```
{% endif %}
## Running Locally

```sh
just dev
```

The app will be available at `http://localhost:3000`.

## Common Tasks

```sh
# Format and lint
just fmt-fix
just lint-fix

# Type check
just typecheck

# Run tests
just test-unit
just test-all

# Full pre-push check
just gate

# Full check including integration and e2e
just gate-expensive
```

## Testing

Tests are organized by type:

- `tests/unit/` — Vitest, fast isolated tests
- `tests/integration/` — Vitest, tests with real dependencies
- `tests/e2e/` — Playwright, end-to-end browser tests

Use `external` in test names for tests that hit external services. These run via `just test-external`.

## Docker

```sh
# Build image
docker build -t {{ project_name }} .

# Run container
docker run -p 3000:3000 {{ project_name }}
```
